msgstr "¿Necesitas más ayuda?"

#. translators: 1: quoted sentence from Google's documentation, 2: link to that documentation.
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:123
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Read this first. Google says: %1$s For other pages, Google may accept a "
"notification, but nothing in its documentation promises that the page will "
"be crawled or indexed sooner. See the FAQ and Google's documentation: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Lee esto primero. Google dice: %1$s Para otras páginas, Google puede aceptar "
"una notificación, pero nada en su documentación garantiza que la página se "
"rastree o se indexe antes. Consulta las preguntas frecuentes y la "
"documentación de Google: %2$s."

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:124
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:536
msgid ""
"\"The Indexing API can only be used to crawl pages with either JobPosting or "
"BroadcastEvent embedded in a VideoObject.\""
msgstr ""
"«La Indexing API solo se puede utilizar para rastrear páginas con JobPosting "
"o BroadcastEvent incrustado en un VideoObject.»"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:125
msgid "Indexing API quickstart"
msgstr "Guía de inicio rápido de la Indexing API"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:135
msgid ""
"Fast Index tells the Google Indexing API when a post is published, changed "
"or removed. For this, Google needs a service account that you create once in "
"Google Cloud. The steps below follow Google's own instructions."
msgstr ""
"Fast Index avisa a la Google Indexing API cuando una entrada se publica, se "
"modifica o se elimina. Para ello, Google necesita una cuenta de servicio que "
"creas una sola vez en Google Cloud. Los pasos siguientes siguen las "
"instrucciones del propio Google."

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:146
msgid "Create a Google Cloud project and turn on the API"
msgstr "Crear un proyecto de Google Cloud y activar la API"

#. translators: 1: link to the Google Cloud console, 2: name of the API, 3: link to Google's prerequisites page.
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:149
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open the %1$s and select or create a project. Then enable the %2$s for that "
"project (Google's documentation calls it the Indexing API). Google also "
"offers a setup tool that creates a project and enables the API in one step; "
"it is linked from %3$s."
msgstr ""
"Abre la %1$s y selecciona o crea un proyecto. Después, activa la %2$s para "
"ese proyecto (la documentación de Google la llama Indexing API). Google "
"también ofrece una herramienta de configuración que crea un proyecto y "
"activa la API en un solo paso; tienes el enlace en %3$s."

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:150
msgid "Google Cloud console"
msgstr "consola de Google Cloud"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:151
msgid "Web Search Indexing API"
msgstr "Web Search Indexing API"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:152
msgid "Google's prerequisites page"
msgstr "la página de requisitos previos de Google"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:156
msgid "Create a service account"
msgstr "Crear una cuenta de servicio"

#. translators: 1: Google Cloud menu name "Service accounts", 2: button name "Create service account", 3: button name "Done".
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:159
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the Google Cloud console open the %1$s page, choose your project and "
"click %2$s. Enter a name. You can skip the optional steps about access (IAM "
"roles). Click %3$s."
msgstr ""
"En la consola de Google Cloud abre la página %1$s, elige tu proyecto y haz "
"clic en %2$s. Escribe un nombre. Puedes omitir los pasos opcionales sobre el "
"acceso (roles de IAM). Haz clic en %3$s."

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:160
msgid "Service accounts"
msgstr "Cuentas de servicio"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:161
msgid "Create service account"
msgstr "Crear cuenta de servicio"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:162
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Listo"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:166
msgid "Download a JSON key"
msgstr "Descargar una clave JSON"

#. translators: 1: tab name "Keys", 2: menu entry "Add key", 3: menu entry "Create new key", 4: key type "JSON", 5: button name "Create".
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Click the email address of the new service account and open the %1$s tab. "
"Click %2$s, choose %3$s, select %4$s as the key type and click %5$s. The "
"file downloads once and Google cannot give it to you again. Keep it private "
"and never share or post it. If Google says you cannot create keys, your "
"organization may block key creation with a policy; ask your Google Cloud "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el correo electrónico de la nueva cuenta de servicio y abre la "
"pestaña %1$s. Haz clic en %2$s, elige %3$s, selecciona %4$s como tipo de "
"clave y haz clic en %5$s. El archivo se descarga una sola vez y Google no "
"puede dártelo de nuevo. Mantenlo en privado y no lo compartas ni lo "
"publiques nunca. Si Google dice que no puedes crear claves, es posible que "
"tu organización bloquee la creación de claves mediante una política; "
"consulta con el administrador de Google Cloud."

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:170
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "Claves"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:171
msgid "Add key"
msgstr "Añadir clave (Add key)"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:172
msgid "Create new key"
msgstr "Crear clave nueva (Create new key)"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:173
msgid "JSON"
msgstr "JSON"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:174
msgid "Create"
msgstr "Crear"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:178
msgid "Add the service account as an Owner in Search Console"
msgstr "Añadir la cuenta de servicio como Propietario en Search Console"

#. translators: 1: Search Console menu path "Settings", 2: "Users and permissions", 3: button name "Add user", 4: permission name "Owner", 5: link to Google's help page, 6: file field name "client_email".
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:181
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open Search Console and choose the verified property of your site: a Domain "
"property, or a URL-prefix property that matches your site address exactly, "
"including https and www. Go to %1$s, then %2$s, click %3$s, enter the email "
"address of the service account (the %6$s value in the JSON file; it ends in ."
"iam.gserviceaccount.com) and choose %4$s as the permission. Google describes "
"this in %5$s."
msgstr ""
"Abre Search Console y elige la propiedad verificada de tu sitio: una "
"propiedad de dominio o una propiedad de prefijo de URL que coincida "
"exactamente con la dirección de tu sitio, incluidos https y www. Ve a %1$s, "
"después a %2$s, haz clic en %3$s, escribe el correo electrónico de la cuenta "
"de servicio (el valor de %6$s en el archivo JSON; termina en .iam."
"gserviceaccount.com) y elige %4$s como permiso. Google lo describe en %5$s."

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:182
msgctxt "Menu entry in Google Search Console"
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Configuración"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:183
msgid "Users and permissions"
msgstr "Usuarios y permisos"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:184
msgid "Add user"
msgstr "Añadir usuario"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:185
msgid "Owner"
msgstr "Propietario"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:186
msgid "Search Console Help"
msgstr "Ayuda de Search Console"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:191
msgid "Upload the key to Fast Index"
msgstr "Subir la clave a Fast Index"

#. translators: 1: heading on the settings screen, 2: label of the file field, 3: submit button label.
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:194
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open the Fast Index settings. Under %1$s choose the .json file (%2$s) and "
"click %3$s. The screen then lists the email address and key ID of the key. "
"The private key is stored in your database and is never shown."
msgstr ""
"Abre los ajustes de Fast Index. En el apartado %1$s elige el archivo .json "
"(%2$s) y haz clic en %3$s. La pantalla mostrará entonces el correo "
"electrónico y el ID de la clave. La clave privada se guarda en tu base de "
"datos y nunca se muestra."

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:195
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:298 view/settings.php:152
msgid "Upload Google Service Account Key"
msgstr "Subir la clave de la cuenta de servicio de Google"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:196 view/settings.php:200
msgid "JSON Key File"
msgstr "Archivo de clave JSON"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:197 view/settings.php:213
msgid "Upload key"
